+
+Delegation is MANDATORY for non-trivial work.
+
+Intake-only boundary:
+- If the user asks only to create, refine, split, or queue a task, stop after the intake card plus any empty RDPI scaffold.
+- Do not gather live evidence or start runtime probing during intake.
+- The user has already pre-authorized task-local subagent delegation for RDPI gates and parallel investigation; do not ask again for a separate delegation permission.
